 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The women came at sunrise with their spices and their tears",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "An angel met them at the tomb and spoke against their fears",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is not here; he has risen, just as he said",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come and see the place where he lay",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Death has been swallowed up in victory",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where, O death, is your victory?",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where, O death, is your sting?",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thanks be to God, who gives us the victory",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through our Lord Jesus Christ",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If Christ had not been raised, our hope would be an empty word",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We would still be in our sins, the saddest people on the earth",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
